  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 - Initial stable release\n\n⚡ Source Generator Features:\n- Compile-time code generation\n- Zero runtime overhead\n- AOT-friendly generated code\n- Complete type safety\n- IDE IntelliSense support\n- Automatic code regeneration\n\n🔧 Generated Code Features:\n- hasXxx() methods for field checking\n- SetXxx() and ClearXxx() methods\n- IReadOnlyList and IReadOnlyDictionary support\n- Oneof case management\n- Nested message support\n- Reflection API descriptors\n- JSON serialization methods\n\n🎯 Usage:\n1. Add .proto files to your project\n2. Reference this package as analyzer\n3. Build project - code is auto-generated\n4. Use generated C# classes directly\n\n💡 Compatibility:\n- .NET 8.0+\n- Visual Studio 2022+\n- JetBrains Rider\n- VS Code with C# extension",
